  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  levelTitle: ANGER
  levelDescription: "Anger is raw survival,\r\na shield, a scream, a storm built
    from every wound you swallowed.\r\nIt makes you strong, but it consumes you if
    you let it speak alone.\r\n\r\nLeft-click for light attacks.\r\nRight-click for
    heavy attacks.\r\nBut beware: every missed strike feeds the fury.\nOnce you win
    head to the topmost area of the map to proceed.\r\nDo not lose yourself to the
    flame.\r"
